# owl-equality-substitution: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/owl-sameAs-ext.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:bob owl:sameAs :robert. :bob :likes :pizza. :alice :knows :bob. :likes owl:sameAs :enjoys.

# Inference rules
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.

{?X owl:sameAs ?Y. ?X ?P ?O} => {?Y ?P ?O}.
{?X owl:sameAs ?Y. ?S ?X ?O} => {?S ?Y ?O}.
{?X owl:sameAs ?Y. ?S ?P ?X} => {?S ?P ?Y}.
